    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate is mandatory to ensure that your bike complies with environmental regulations. An up-to-date PUC certificate must be provided to verify that your bike meets the required emission standards.</p>
