<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Additionally, opting for <strong>100% Declared-Value Marine Transit Insurance</strong> is highly recommended for added peace of mind.</p>
